  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sashimi-cut eggplant and cook until it is tender.",
    "Add the cumin powder, coriander powder, salt, and black pepper and stir well.",
    "Add the basmati rice and stir well to combine with the eggplant mixture.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cover the pan with a tight-fitting lid.",
    "Cook for 20 minutes or until the rice is cooked and the liquid is absorbed.",
    "Turn off the heat and let it rest for 5 minutes before serving."
